                    "- MT019 - Abort Notification -  notifies the sender that the system has been unable to deliver the message specified in the <text-block>, and has been forced to abort it instead."
                    "- MT028 - FINCopy message status report."
                    "- MT029 - Copy message status report (response to the MT028)."
                    "- MT096 - FINCopy to server destination message."
                    "- MT097 - FINCopy message authorisation/refusal notification."
