                    "Removed (4), (5), (6), (7) + table"
                    "The instructing agent of a payment message should ensure that MUR (field tag 108) contains the\n\t\t\ttransaction reference number (TRN) to provide an audit trail of the HVCS payment through the\n\t\t\tHVCS clearing and settlement process."
                ] meta {
                    html::attributes = {
                        class = "doc-comment-content"
                    }
                }
            ] meta {
                html::attributes = {
                    class = "doc-comment"
                    data-change-id = "UG2025"
                }
            }
            "This clause has been deleted (UG2025 November 2025)."
            "This clause has been deleted (UG2025 November 2025)."
            "This clause has been deleted (UG2025 November 2025)."
            "This clause has been deleted (UG2025 November 2025)."
